<title>UK: LME copper slips off highs by end of AM kerb.</title>
<headline>LME copper slips off highs by end of AM kerb.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Three months ends AM kerb off highs and little changed from Monday after profit-taking hits thin market. Cash/threes spread steady near previous levels around $255 backwardation.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Weaker, ends morning at $14 down at $1,570.</p>
<p>ZINC - Slightly softer at $1,489. OTHERS - Also easier.</p>
</text>
